When exporting, you can filter by date range, user, action type, severity, and IP address. This means you can generate precise reports - for example, "all login failures for the finance department in Q1" or "all role changes by administrators in the last 30 days."
The export includes all relevant metadata, and we can also generate compliance reports formatted specifically for SOC2, ISO 27001, or GDPR requirements.
For regular auditing needs, you can schedule automatic exports to be emailed to your compliance team or uploaded to a secure location.
